    "body": "Two improvements to keep Zendesk and relay-manager age review clocks in sync:\n\n1. **Create Zendesk ticket at case creation/restriction**, not just at parent contact submission. Agents should see the case in Zendesk from the start.\n\n2. **Set the Age Review Deadline custom field** on the ticket using the `deadline_at` value from the relay-manager case. Keeps the Zendesk queue's deadline column populated and in sync with the authoritative relay-manager clock.\n\nRelay-manager clock remains authoritative (auto-closes expired cases). Zendesk deadline field provides agent visibility in their existing workflow.\n\nFuture consideration: sync clock pause/resume to the Zendesk deadline field. Lower priority since agents see the parent reply in the ticket itself.\n\nParent: divinevideo/support-trust-safety#138",
